(5. Key Takeaways) Tj
/F1 9.5 Tf
0 -14 Td
(1. Java guarantees robust memory safety and cross-platform compatibility through bytecode compilation.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(2. Use interfaces to define capability contracts and decouple dependencies; prefer composition over deep inheritance.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(3. Leverage generics in the Collections Framework to prevent runtime ClassCastExceptions.) Tj
0 -12 Td
(4. Implement try-with-resources \(AutoCloseable\) to eliminate resource leakage for streams, sockets, and connections.) Tj
